[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Dashboard API

[VERIFICATION]
UID: VER-BE-001
METHOD: Test
TITLE: Every change changes the etag
STATEMENT: >>>
Each kind of task, agenda and profile change made through the API produces a different ``/api/dashboard/etag`` value.
<<<
TEST: >>>
backend/tests/test_dashboard_sync.py: test_every_task_change_changes_the_etag, test_every_agenda_change_changes_the_etag, test_changing_a_profile_color_changes_the_etag
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-001
  ROLE: Verifies

[VERIFICATION]
UID: VER-BE-002
METHOD: Test
TITLE: Range limit
STATEMENT: >>>
A 12-week range returns 12 weeks; a 13-week range returns HTTP 400.
<<<
TEST: >>>
backend/tests/test_dashboard_sync.py: test_dashboard_range_is_limited_to_twelve_weeks
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-002
  ROLE: Verifies

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Tasks

[VERIFICATION]
UID: VER-BE-003
METHOD: Test
TITLE: Who may complete tasks
STATEMENT: >>>
The task's own person (without manager rights), a task manager, an administrator and a wall tablet token can complete a task; another user on a phone gets HTTP 403 with a Dutch message and the task stays open. The own person still cannot edit the task.
<<<
TEST: >>>
backend/tests/test_task_completion.py
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-BE-024
  ROLE: Verifies

[[/SECTION]]
